# ESP32 Embedded Projects

Two ESP32 + FreeRTOS/embedded control projects, simulated in Wokwi.

| Folder | Project |
|---|---|
| `01-freertos-multitask-scheduler` | Multi-tasking RTOS firmware scheduler: sensor, display and emergency alarm tasks with queue, task notification and mutex |
| `02-conveyor-speed-regulator` | Automated mini conveyor belt: L298N + DC motor + optical sensor, closed-loop PID speed control |
| `03-datalogger-node` | Datalogger node: DHT22 data on I2C OLED while logging timestamped records to SPI microSD |

Each folder has its own README with wiring, design, and test results.

Author: Sandeep Dhangar
